      "body": "A **perfect 5th** is 7 half steps and spans five letters, like C to G.\n\n**Why it matters:** It is the open sound of rock guitar, and a low note plus the note a 5th above is how many left hands start. Twinkle Twinkle jumps up a 5th on the second \"twinkle\".",
